  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Reflective verbs",
   "texto": [
    "**Sich treffen** and **sich freuen** have a reflective pronoun here in accusative: **ich treffe mich**, **du triffst dich**, **er/sie/es trifft sich**, **wir treffen uns**, **ihr trefft euch**, **sie/Sie treffen sich**. The termination of the verb changes with the person, as in other verbs."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Make fun of something.",
   "texto": [
    "With **sich freuen** **auf** is used for something that comes (to want) and, if it has already happened, **über**: **Ich freue mich auf den Urlaub** (I want the holidays). The pronoun does not change position: **Wir freuen uns auf das Konzert**."
   ]
  },
